WEBVTT

00:24.210 --> 00:27.200
Do you feel that, Adonis?

00:27.200 --> 00:32.210
You know, déjà vu.

00:35.280 --> 00:36.960
It hurts...

00:40.100 --> 00:41.730
Don't fuck with me.

00:47.860 --> 00:50.230
<b>Meta</b>

00:47.860 --> 00:50.230
<b>Dispel</b>

01:24.010 --> 01:26.010
Hey, hang in there!

01:27.740 --> 01:33.520
Adonis? Listen, I...

01:35.420 --> 01:39.200
I can't see anything anymore.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.290
<i>She's bleeding so much.</i>

03:20.320 --> 03:21.920
<i>At this rate...</i>

03:23.960 --> 03:29.220
But it's okay. I'm okay.

03:29.220 --> 03:32.720
This is nothing.

03:33.320 --> 03:36.120
<i>Think, think.</i>

03:36.120 --> 03:37.640
<i>How can I stop the bleeding?</i>

03:38.480 --> 03:43.730
Run. I'll catch up to you later.

03:44.090 --> 03:45.490
Shut up!

03:46.920 --> 03:48.830
Ta-da!

03:51.480 --> 03:53.240
Got her balls.

03:55.730 --> 03:59.000
Now <i>that</i> was funny. Right?

04:01.340 --> 04:04.760
What's wrong with you? C'mon, laugh.

04:07.320 --> 04:09.020
Her eyes...

04:12.500 --> 04:14.000
Give them back.

04:15.460 --> 04:17.400
No, fix her.

04:19.030 --> 04:20.680
Right now.

04:35.560 --> 04:38.050
I told you to laugh.

04:38.050 --> 04:40.640
You're no fun.

04:44.920 --> 04:48.000
Come at me, Adonis.

04:48.720 --> 04:51.670
You've got balls, too, don't you?

04:53.430 --> 04:56.340
Shirousagi!

05:24.780 --> 05:27.160
<i>Am I still the same as I was back then?</i>

05:32.940 --> 05:35.000
<i>Has nothing changed?</i>

05:47.510 --> 05:51.600
Written-Style Summoning Magic: Cainz.

05:49.910 --> 05:51.910
<b>Cainz</b>

05:55.050 --> 05:57.440
<i>I am the apprentice...</i>

06:00.920 --> 06:02.830
<i>of a great witch!</i>

06:15.040 --> 06:17.170
That was close.

06:19.800 --> 06:20.680
Huh?

06:21.440 --> 06:22.940
Where'd you go?

06:29.970 --> 06:32.000
It's crude, but we don't have a choice.

06:35.040 --> 06:37.700
It'll only last a moment. Try to bear it.

06:37.700 --> 06:42.200
Okay. I don't know what you're going to do,

06:43.520 --> 06:45.720
but I trust you.

06:47.040 --> 06:47.960
Here we go.

07:07.950 --> 07:10.480
Thank you.

07:12.190 --> 07:17.960
Adonis, I'm sorry.

07:17.960 --> 07:19.280
Don't speak.

07:30.060 --> 07:31.650
Adonis.

07:32.210 --> 07:33.760
I said don't speak.

07:33.760 --> 07:42.760
Imagine you and I lived in the same town

07:43.320 --> 07:47.270
and attended the same school

07:48.540 --> 07:54.620
and lived ordinary and uneventful lives,

07:55.300 --> 08:02.200
getting mad and laughing 
at ordinary things...

08:05.450 --> 08:12.640
All I wanted was that kind of ordinary life.

08:12.640 --> 08:17.860
Why did things turn out this way?

08:18.880 --> 08:23.030
Where did I go wrong?

08:24.710 --> 08:26.400
Hey, Doroka!

08:36.140 --> 08:38.470
School, huh?

08:47.160 --> 08:49.410
Don't say the same thing she said.

08:53.640 --> 08:55.910
I couldn't protect a single woman.

08:57.560 --> 08:59.330
That's not okay.

09:08.890 --> 09:12.030
Hey, little Adonis.

09:12.030 --> 09:15.030
Where did you go?

09:25.540 --> 09:29.040
Deluxe!

09:29.040 --> 09:32.040
I love this kind of thing!

09:32.040 --> 09:36.550
Sir, that's what he used 
to attack the capital.

09:36.920 --> 09:38.950
It's stupidly destructive.

09:39.300 --> 09:42.680
Okay, okay. Bring it on.

09:47.950 --> 09:49.400
Wow!

09:51.640 --> 09:53.840
That was close.

09:57.090 --> 09:59.090
Hey, rabbit.

09:59.090 --> 10:02.190
Call your beloved queen here.

10:02.570 --> 10:03.450
Huh?

10:03.450 --> 10:05.460
I'll blind her as payback!

10:06.120 --> 10:07.200
What?

10:08.710 --> 10:13.320
You'll make <i>who</i> look like 
that filthy little thing?

10:17.210 --> 10:20.210
I'll crush you, stupid brat.

10:20.390 --> 10:22.720
Shut up, you stupid rabbit.

10:39.740 --> 10:42.740
Symbol of

10:39.740 --> 10:42.740
Reconciliation

11:06.280 --> 11:08.770
Shirousagi!

11:08.770 --> 11:13.150
Little Adonis!

11:25.280 --> 11:29.170
What's the matter, Adonis boy?

11:34.940 --> 11:38.290
After all that talk, 
that's the best you can do?

11:48.210 --> 11:50.600
Good effort.

12:00.320 --> 12:02.070
Too slow!

12:06.480 --> 12:10.600
You know that magic's weakness, don't you?

12:11.520 --> 12:14.830
There's a delay between 
writing and activation.

12:15.140 --> 12:17.330
It's just pseudo-magic.

12:18.080 --> 12:21.350
Blame yourself for being born human.

12:21.880 --> 12:25.080
Fix her eyes already.

12:25.590 --> 12:27.310
Forget about that.

12:31.160 --> 12:33.600
Just die, okay?

12:45.220 --> 12:47.140
Adonis?

12:48.120 --> 12:50.930
Adonis, where are you?

12:50.930 --> 12:52.110
Are you okay?

12:52.340 --> 12:56.570
H-Hey, answer me, Ado—

13:00.830 --> 13:04.630
What am I going to do? I can't see anything.

13:05.800 --> 13:09.300
I can't find him like this.

13:10.130 --> 13:11.490
Doroka.

13:13.050 --> 13:14.640
Adonis?

13:14.640 --> 13:17.010
Yeah, it's me.

13:17.640 --> 13:20.400
Oh, good. You're all right.

13:20.400 --> 13:23.660
Yeah, it's me. I'm totally Adonis.

13:23.910 --> 13:25.660
No.

13:25.660 --> 13:27.080
Who are you?

13:27.520 --> 13:29.910
Where is Adonis?

13:29.910 --> 13:35.160
Ma'am, is this the item you're looking for?

13:35.160 --> 13:37.100
That voice...

13:38.100 --> 13:39.920
Mr. Shirousagi?

13:40.500 --> 13:43.920
R... Run...

13:46.120 --> 13:47.190
Are you okay?

14:03.890 --> 14:07.880
What is this? What's happening?

14:08.260 --> 14:11.360
What is this sound?

14:11.360 --> 14:13.080
Stop.

14:22.820 --> 14:24.070
No!

14:34.310 --> 14:40.050
It pisses me off when you speak 
with the queen's voice.

14:40.710 --> 14:45.250
At least I changed your face.

14:56.980 --> 14:59.060
We met by chance.

15:03.280 --> 15:09.090
But when I learned 
that chance was inevitable,

15:09.800 --> 15:13.100
I became a slave to love...

15:17.570 --> 15:21.780
and felt a joy I wanted 
to proclaim to the world.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.660
Know what that's like?

15:27.790 --> 15:30.340
It doesn't matter if you don't.

15:31.200 --> 15:35.490
The moment of your destiny has arrived.

15:36.510 --> 15:40.000
The world doesn't need 
two of the same witch.

15:40.800 --> 15:45.720
Even if it's just a prank 
of the ensembleverse,

15:47.640 --> 15:51.440
Adonis' death is a predetermined harmony.

15:52.900 --> 15:58.020
I don't know what you're talking about,

15:58.970 --> 16:03.280
but aren't witches the enemy of humanity?

16:07.980 --> 16:11.530
Please leave Adonis alone.

16:12.430 --> 16:15.560
I know what he did.

16:16.770 --> 16:22.120
I saw the people fleeing 
and the city being destroyed.

16:24.370 --> 16:31.140
But that only happened 
because you started hunting witches.

16:33.730 --> 16:36.370
I wanted to end the fighting.

16:37.940 --> 16:42.520
I wanted to believe 
revenge wasn't everything.

16:42.980 --> 16:49.770
But now I'm not sure 
if humans should be forgiven.

16:50.700 --> 16:56.740
After everything they've done to me, 
I can't believe revenge is wrong anymore.

17:05.960 --> 17:09.110
I don't care what you have to say.

17:09.520 --> 17:12.290
All I want is Adonis' head.

17:13.010 --> 17:18.720
I told you... to stop.

17:20.490 --> 17:23.410
Doroka...

17:28.790 --> 17:31.050
I have a request.

17:32.680 --> 17:35.560
Cast your Love Spell on me.

17:37.320 --> 17:44.330
If it'll allow me to move my body, 
I'll become your marionette.

17:45.110 --> 17:46.430
But...

17:46.830 --> 17:51.840
Hurry. Otherwise we're both...

17:51.840 --> 17:54.460
Ugh, boring.

17:55.140 --> 17:58.600
You're pissing me off.

18:00.600 --> 18:06.600
Don't waste your time 
trying to fight back now, scum.

18:07.400 --> 18:10.470
Doroka, please.

18:11.410 --> 18:15.110
Let's get your beheading over with.

18:19.390 --> 18:20.880
Fine.

18:21.620 --> 18:23.370
<b>Fight Back</b>

18:25.010 --> 18:30.370
I'm sorry that I ended up...

18:30.380 --> 18:32.380
<b>Fight Back</b>

18:30.380 --> 18:32.380
<b>Fight Back</b>

18:30.380 --> 18:32.380
<b>Fight Back</b>

18:30.380 --> 18:32.380
<b>Fight Back</b>

18:32.710 --> 18:36.010
using my magic on you like this.

18:38.630 --> 18:41.640
<b>Fight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back</b>

18:38.630 --> 18:41.640
<b>Fight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back\h\h\h\h\h\hFight Back</b>

18:38.630 --> 18:41.640
<b>Fight Back












Fight Back</b>

18:42.830 --> 18:47.410
Forgive me, Chloe!

18:59.400 --> 19:01.410
Seriously?

19:01.680 --> 19:03.160
You don't know when to—

19:16.800 --> 19:17.940
Adonis.

19:19.670 --> 19:24.050
Hey, Doroka. Is it true 
that your magic is obscene?

19:24.050 --> 19:28.800
Your Love Spell allows you 
to control human men, right?

19:28.800 --> 19:33.090
Ugh, why would anyone want to control them?

19:33.090 --> 19:34.820
Gross.

19:34.820 --> 19:39.350
Keep your slut magic away from us, Doroka.

19:39.350 --> 19:44.120
Don't tell the humans 
about your magic, okay?

19:44.120 --> 19:46.930
We don't want them to think we're like you.

19:46.930 --> 19:48.320
Yeah, seriously.

19:48.320 --> 19:54.460
Y-You're right. Sorry, guys.

19:56.040 --> 19:58.460
Indecent and obscene.

19:59.010 --> 20:01.460
Impure magic.

20:02.010 --> 20:06.080
For our noble kind, your magic is so vulgar,

20:06.080 --> 20:10.440
we don't want others 
to know of its existence.

20:11.500 --> 20:15.990
You are a stain on witchkind, Doroka.

20:19.510 --> 20:22.240
I am a vulgar witch.

20:22.730 --> 20:37.260
I must be a good witch, I must be 
a good witch, I must be a good witch...

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Repulsive

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Sordid

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Shameful

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Foul

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Smutty

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Grotesque

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Dirty

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Hindrance

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Vulgar

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Disgusting

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Improper

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Filthy

20:31.250 --> 20:37.260
Callous

20:37.950 --> 20:40.260
I finally get it now.

20:40.260 --> 20:41.760
What?

20:42.050 --> 20:46.040
The reason you're so desperate to be pure.

20:50.400 --> 20:53.520
You worry about everything too much.

20:54.780 --> 20:56.560
Don't hold back.

20:56.560 --> 20:59.260
Use me without restraint.

20:59.260 --> 21:00.980
Don't worry.

21:00.980 --> 21:04.510
I won't actually fall in love
with you, you dumbass.

21:08.780 --> 21:10.030
Okay.

21:24.550 --> 21:28.550
<b>Love Spell
Knightfall</b>

21:32.060 --> 21:36.370
Adonis, you'll move free 
of gravity's constraints.

21:36.370 --> 21:38.850
No one can stop you now.

21:39.310 --> 21:42.760
All your wounds have closed.

21:42.760 --> 21:45.830
Your bones aren't broken.

21:47.150 --> 21:51.070
Your magic is limitless!

21:57.980 --> 21:59.580
No way.

21:59.580 --> 22:02.590
The Love Spell can do that?

22:03.120 --> 22:08.280
No one can beat Adonis now!

22:10.780 --> 22:12.650
This is bad!

22:22.020 --> 22:24.610
<b>Quinblade</b>

22:22.570 --> 22:24.050
Quinblade.

22:36.350 --> 22:38.500
As you wish...

22:40.050 --> 22:41.060
princess.
